<title>UK: World Bank ups zero coupon bond to 3.5 bln rand.</title>
<headline>World Bank ups zero coupon bond to 3.5 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 3.5 billion rand from 3.0 billion rand lead manager Hambros Bank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    3.5 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    04.APR.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  7.45	PAY DATE    04.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 2.5 BLN RAND ON 05.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIP     0.10</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
